id: SCA-014
title: Suspicious setup.py cmdclass override
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: setup.py
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: cmdclass\s*=\s*\{[^}]*(install|develop|build_ext|bdist_wheel|sdist)
    message: Overriding setuptools command classes (install, develop, build_ext) allows arbitrary code execution during any pip operation.
fix: Avoid cmdclass overrides unless necessary. Audit any override for network calls, file writes outside the package, or encoded payloads.
